<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Administrator Invitations — LYCEE BATOURI</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/m1-preview.css"><script src="/js/canonical-invitations.js" defer></script><%- include('partials/workspace-assets') %></head>
<body class="lms-ui lms-account-page"><header><a href="/" class="brand">LYCEE BATOURI <span>Administrator invitations</span></a></header><main><%- include('partials/workspace-wayfinding',{workspaceMode:'School',workspaceHome:'/school'}) %><p id="message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><section id="workspace" hidden><p id="already-admin" hidden>You already have administrator access. <a href="/">Return to your workspace</a>.</p><div class="panel" id="accept-panel"><h1>Accept an invitation</h1><p>Use your own existing staff account. After acceptance you will return to sign-in with your current account type and password.</p><form id="accept"><label>Invitation token<input id="token" type="password" autocomplete="off" required minlength="43" maxlength="43"></label><button>Accept administrator invitation</button></form></div>
<section id="operator" hidden><div class="panel"><h2>Current verified administrators</h2><p>Remove only an accepted additional administrator role. Teaching access and passwords are preserved; the staff member must sign in again on all devices. Original administrators and platform operators require separate recovery review.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Staff member</th><th>Profile</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="administrators"></tbody></table></div></div><div class="panel"><h2>Invite existing school staff</h2><p>Only verified, active staff in LYCEE BATOURI are eligible. The recipient must sign in and accept the invitation; no password is created or changed.</p><form id="issue"><label>Staff member<select id="account" required></select></label><button>Issue administrator invitation</button></form><p id="secret-note" hidden>Copy this token now and give it securely to the selected staff member. It is shown only once and expires after 24 hours.</p><output id="issued-token"></output></div><div class="panel"><h2>Issued invitations</h2><button id="refresh" type="button">Refresh</button><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Account</th><th>Status</th><th>Expires</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="invitations"></tbody></table></div></div></section></section></main></body></html>
